*
* FOLLOWING IS DONE HERE
*
* VARY ONLINE EVERYTHING - CURES A PROBLEM FOR MVS
*
* DRAIN ALL UR STUFF - USER CAN START AS REQUIRED
*
* AUTOLOG ON CPWATCH
* AND SET ITS PRIOR TO 1
*
* ENABLE ALL 3270 TERMINALS ETC
*
* MOUNT THE VM/370PLUS LANGUAGE DISK (VMLANG, MAINT 19F)
*
* START THE SOCKET CARD READERS 10C AND 20C (VMSPOOL, 9.41)
*
* AUTOLOG THE NICOF PROXIES NICOFPXY AND TCPIPPXY
*
* LOG MYSELF OFF
*
CP VARY ON 000-FFF
DR ALL
*P AUTOLOG CPWATCH CPWATCH
CP VARY ON 000-FFF
CP EN ALL
CP VARY ON 000-FFF
CP DR ALL
CP ATTACH 182 TO SYSTEM AS VMLANG
* 9.41: THE SOCKET CARD READERS (VMSPOOL ON THE PC) READ AT ONCE
CP START 10C
CP START 20C
*P SET PRIOR CPWATCH 5
* LOG ON CMSBATCH MACHINE
* THE AUTOLOG FORM IS AUTOLOG <NAME> <USERID> <1ST COMMAND>
CP AUTOLOG CMSBATCH CMSBATCH CMSBATCH
CP AUTOLOG WAKEUP WAKEUP EXEC WAKEPROF
* NICOF INSIDE PROXIES (9.13D): SOCKETS, FTP AND HOST FILES FOR CMS
CP AUTOLOG NICOFPXY NICOFPXY
CP AUTOLOG TCPIPPXY TCPIPPXY
CP WNG OPERATOR AUTOLOG1 DONE - LOGGING OFF
CP LOGOFF
